OL,3,GNEWSAMeadows restored by charity man
OL,4,Aset up as dying wish
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity set up by a man with
OL,7,Fincurable cancer a year before he died
OL,8,Fhas promised to restore 250 acres of
OL,9,Fwildflower meadows on Exmoor.
OL,11,FMark Burges Watson was undergoing
OL,12,Fintensive treatment for pancreatic
OL,13,Fcancer when he set up Burge's Meadows.
OL,15,FThe charity's aim is to sow 1,000 acres
OL,16,Fof wildflower meadows across England
OL,17,Fand Wales over the next decade.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
