OL,3,GNEWSAMeadows restored by charity man
OL,4,Aset up as dying wish
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark's widow, Fiona Burgess Watson,
OL,7,Fsaid: "At one stage he was having
OL,8,Fchemotherapy every single week, so it
OL,9,Fdidn't necessarily seem like the best
OL,10,Ftime to be setting up a charity but he
OL,11,Fwas absolutely determined that he was
OL,12,Fgoing to do it."
